Z||000003||1FST2M6||06-18-2001||01:46 PM||||   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstlow.jpg">    <P>the offsets you are asking are fine... i've got 42mm (7") up front and 45 in the back (on a 8" wheel) 17s and they are fine.. Hyptnotise had 18s on his and there is white GT with white 17/18 combo here on the board too that is KILLER<P>oh uum your 245 is abit excessive though.. if you can break a 225-40 loose you've REALLy accomplished somthing.. a 245 is just guun cost more for no real return in performance...  (215-45 front  -  235-40 rear on mine...) i had 245s on an SE and they were just heavyier and looked strange.. the 235s sit well and a 225- on an 18 is gunna be JUUUUST fine..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/travis.jpg"> <BR> <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 06-18-2001).]||||reg||1
